**/__pycache__/*
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/data/
# Shipped recon resolver lists are REQUIRED at runtime and asserted by
# test_recon_foundations; un-ignore just this dir's .txt lists so a clean CI
# checkout receives them (the broad `**/data/` rule above must keep generated
# runtime data out — hence the narrow re-include of the `data/` path down to
# the files; git won't descend into an ignored dir, so each level is re-included).
!agent/scripts/assess/data/
!agent/scripts/assess/data/resolvers/
!agent/scripts/assess/data/resolvers/*.txt
**/*.egg-info/
*.sqlite3
*.db
.env
.runtime-data/
workspace/
opencode-home/
agent/engagements/*
!agent/engagements/.gitkeep
CLAUDE-REVIEW.md
CODEX-FINDINGS.md

# Build artifacts (note: `**/*.egg-info/` is already covered above; `**/build/`
# catches build/ at any path including the repo root)
**/build/
prev-issues.md
potentially-updated-issues.md

# Benchmark harness (`vigil bench`). Artifacts, manifests, the judge-only
# answer key, and the plaintext per-run flags live off-tree under
# $VIGIL_BENCH_HOME (default ~/.vigil-bench) by design; these patterns are a
# defensive backstop in case that home is ever pointed inside the repo.
.vigil-bench/
bench-results/
